(alts $erase
  (alt $LegendMultiset
    (witness legend-repeat borderline concept
      (relaxed legend-corner)
      (separates "The legend holds color 4 twice, and one panel holds 4 once with 1. The color-set test erases that panel; the multiset test keeps it; the stored count of 3 finds only 2 legend colors and erases no panel.")
